                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have some incredible news to share! This fall, every Kingdom Wars game is getting a Definitive Edition HD remaster — absolutely free for you.\n\n\n\nI know I’ve let some of you down over the years. KW games were buggy and too similar. I was often just one man, and I really did try. But you deserved better, and I’m sorry.\n\n\n\nNow indie.io has stepped in. They saw the potential in Kingdom Wars, took over the franchise, and have put their full resources into it. And it’s time to present you with the results.\n\n\n\nWe start with the Medieval Kingdom Wars HD DE launch on October 30, followed by another game each week. It will be a free downloadable update.\n\n\n\nThere will be a rebuilt game engine, reworked graphics, a brand-new UI, bug fixes, and a lot of changes to make each game more unique.\n\n\n\nBut if you want to see what’s coming right now, check out Everyone Will Die — indie.io’s city builder/tower defense/grand strategy game, built on top of Kingdom Wars. You’ll see the rebuilt engine and all the improvements in action. It’s not another clone. \n\n\n\nAlso, it's completely free to download and play right now.\n\nThats the message i got in an email from \"publicrelations@reverieworld.com\".\n\nStill havent gotten the remastered game as the email suggested.....make of that as you will....",
